CREATE TABLE "PricingReferenceParameter" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"kind" TEXT NOT NULL,"lineageId" TEXT NOT NULL,"version" INTEGER NOT NULL,"payload" JSONB NOT NULL,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceParameter_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceParameter_kind_check" CHECK ("kind" IN ('SCENARIO','CURVE','REVIEW')),CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceParameter_version_check" CHECK ("version">0));
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "PricingReferenceParameter_kind_lineageId_version_key" ON "PricingReferenceParameter"("kind","lineageId","version");
CREATE INDEX "PricingReferenceParameter_kind_createdAt_idx" ON "PricingReferenceParameter"("kind","createdAt");
CREATE TABLE "PricingReferenceRun" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"revision" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"scenarioVersionId" TEXT NOT NULL,"recalculatedFromId" TEXT,"snapshot" JSONB NOT NULL,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceRun_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"),CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceRun_revision_check" CHECK ("revision"=0));
CREATE TABLE "PricingReferenceAdoption" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"runId" TEXT NOT NULL,"groupKey" TEXT NOT NULL,"productId" TEXT NOT NULL,"productVersionId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceAdoption_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"));
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "PricingReferenceAdoption_productVersionId_key" ON "PricingReferenceAdoption"("productVersionId");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "PricingReferenceAdoption_runId_groupKey_key" ON "PricingReferenceAdoption"("runId","groupKey");
ALTER TABLE "PricingReferenceAdoption" ADD CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceAdoption_runId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("runId") REFERENCES "PricingReferenceRun"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT ON UPDATE CASCADE;
CREATE TABLE "PricingReferenceCommand" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"actorId" TEXT NOT NULL,"resourceId" TEXT NOT NULL,"action" TEXT NOT NULL,"key" TEXT NOT NULL,"requestHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"resultSnapshot" JSONB NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "PricingReferenceCommand_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"));
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "PricingReferenceCommand_actorId_resourceId_action_key_key" ON "PricingReferenceCommand"("actorId","resourceId","action","key");
